  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Sabbisetti Murali Krishna vs State Of Andhra Pradesh on 11 July, 2019 Honourable Sri Justice D.V.S.S. Somayajulu Criminal Petition No.4012 of 2019 Order:",
    "facts": "This Criminal Petition is filed by the petitioners under Section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure to quash the proceedings against the petitioners, in C.C.No.339 of 2019, on the file of Court of the Special Judicial First Class Magistrate for Excise, Eluru. The offences alleged are under Section 273 of IPC and Section 54 read with 59 of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. The same was also followed in Criminal Petition No.1697 of 2019 and others by the learned single Judges of this Court.",
    "arguments": "Both the counsels agree that this matter is squarely covered by the judgment of the single Judge in the batch petitions bearing Criminal Petition Nos.3731 of 2018 and others.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "Both the counsels agree that this matter is squarely covered by the judgment of the single Judge in the batch petitions bearing Criminal Petition Nos.3731 of 2018 and others.",
